            "author_association": "CONTRIBUTOR",
            "body": "Actually, the ` --field-match-separator` argument is not recognized by `rg` (?):\r\n```bash\r\n$ rg --version\r\nripgrep 11.0.2\r\n# ...\r\n$ rg foo --field-match-separator='\\0'\r\nerror: Found argument '--field-match-separator' which wasn't expected, or isn't valid in this context\r\n# ...\r\n$ rg --help | rg 'field-match'\r\n$ # empty result\r\n```",
