            "author_association": "MEMBER",
            "body": "> ```\r\n> ripgrep 13.0.0\r\n> -SIMD -AVX (compiled)\r\n> +SIMD +AVX (runtime)\r\n> ```\r\n\r\nThis is really strange because 13.0.0 version has necessary option available (judging by the release notes). And as far as I can tell, nothing in newer release notes indicate that its behavior had issues after the initial release.",
