            "body": "> So, I just built 13.0.0 from source, to share what I see:\n> ... \n> Then I built 14.0.0, and it works:\n> ... \n\nAh, I see, thanks! Both the `rg` option and picker work, it's just that 13.0.0 doesn't seem to use \"true\" null character. I'll take a look, but don't think it will be resolved on 'mini.pick' side.",
