        {
            "author_association": "MEMBER",
            "body": "To clarify, I hope you did not think I was asking you to resolve, but I do agree with @lrntgr that something needs to be documented. As I mentioned, I read the commit messages, saw the breaking change this morning, excited to test only to find broken behavior (as I was on 13). My first instinct was to go look at the commit message again to see if I missed something that I was supposed to do—nothing. And it was only because I read all things mini that I saw this thread and knew it had to be my rg version.",
