        {
            "author_association": "MEMBER",
            "body": "So... After more `man rg` reading, some trial and error later I think there is a more robust way of using the `--field-match-separator` option. Initially 'mini.pick' used `--field-match-separator=\\\\0` while the `--field-match-separator \\\\x00` form proved to work starting from `rg` version 13.0.0. This now should be fixed on latest `main`.\r\n\r\n@pkazmier, thanks for the initial note about the difference between 13.0.0 and 14.0.0. I wouldn't be comfortable having to strictly rely on 14.0.0 as it was released less than 8 months ago.\r\n\r\nThat said, I still think that adding that `rg` needs to be at least 13.0.0 is a bit too much because it is more than 3 years old. **If** the minimum version ended up being 14.0.0, then I'd for sure add the version requirement.",
